se your first components provided by OUDS Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will use original components of OUDS and richer ones"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-4-use-other-components"],"image":"ic_component_intro.png"},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-5-styling-things"],"image":"ic_design_token_intro.png","name":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is not only about components and themes. It provides view modifiers, typographies and tokens which can be used. You will learn how."}]}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-6-going-further"],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","name":"Go further with more ressources","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can have questions and issues, and there are resources online. Let’s see that together."}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/table-of-contents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"overview","metadata":{"role":"overview","category":"Orange Unified Design System","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents","estimatedTime":"2hr 5min","title":"Swift Package iOS Tutorial"},"hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents","paths":[]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents":{"title":"Swift Package iOS Tutorial","abstract":[{"text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":