SThemesContract/tutorial-2-instanciate-theme":{"title":"Instanciate and inject a theme","abstract":[{"text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-2-instanciate-theme","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-2-instanciate-theme","type":"topic","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"15min"},"ic_unified_ds.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_unified_ds.png"}],"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","alt":"Logo of OUDS","type":"image"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-5-styling-things":{"title":"Styling things","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that."}],"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-5-styling-things","role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-5-styling-things","type":"topic","kind":"project","estimatedTime":"30min"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-3-use-first-components":{"url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-3-use-first-components","role":"project","type":"topic","kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use.","type":"text"}],"title":"Use your first OUDS components","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-3-use-first-components","estimatedTime":"30min"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-1-package-and-l